Xu20223066,E2DNet: An Ensembling Deep Neural Network for Solving Nonconvex Economic Dispatch in Smart Grid,doe,10,1,pdf,5,no,no,"Finally, after collecting the solutions from all deployed algorithms, the solution with the least power generation cost is selected as the ground truth. Repeatedly executing this ensemble framework with arbitrary distinct problem parameters, we can ﬁnally get the entire dataset (P d,t (k),U 1−N,t (k),...,ϕ mN,t(k),{P∗ i,t (k)}N i=1)K k=1, where k indexes the data sample. After that, the dataset is randomly divided into a training set, a validation set, and a test set at a ratio of 7:1:2 with reference to commonly used training strate- gies [18]."
