Dong2022,Optimization strategy based on robust model predictive control for RES-CCHP system under multiple uncertainties,pattern,6,15,pdf,12,no,no,"Optimized strategy RMPC-based optimization with rolling dispatch of all equipment RMPC-based optimization with day-ahead scheduling of ESU Cost (CNY) 19,941 17,518 Table 6 Computational time for each time interval of OS. Computational time GPR-based prediction RMPC-based optimization Total time (15 min) Max (s) 6.5772 2.1167 8.6939 Table 7 Operating costs of different OSs. Optimized algorithm RMPC-based optimization TMPC-based optimization Operating costs (CNY) 17,518 19,789 X."
Dong2022,Optimization strategy based on robust model predictive control for RES-CCHP system under multiple uncertainties,pattern,7,15,pdf,3,no,no,"Therefore, to improve the robust and economic performance of the intraday operations of the RES-CCHP system under the multiple uncertainties of RES generation and load consumption, this study pro - poses an OS based on robust MPC (RMPC) and considers the uncertainty characteristics of source-load in the optimization modeling. The primary contributions of this study are summarized as follows: (1) An integrated uncertainty rolling optimization framework (ROF) that includes the probability distribution of prediction and un - certainty rolling optimization is established. Specifically, under the framework, forecasting and optimization are implemented on a rolling time horizon, and the probability distribution of pre - diction uses different time scales and can be corrected as per the system ’ s current state. (2) Based on the uncertainty ROF, an RMPC-based OS involving GPR- based source-load prediction and minimum – maximum (min - – max) rolling optimization is proposed."
Dong2022,Optimization strategy based on robust model predictive control for RES-CCHP system under multiple uncertainties,pattern,8,14,abstract,,no,no,"To address this limitation, an integrated uncertainty rolling optimization framework for combining the probability distribution of prediction and uncertainty optimization is established. Under this framework, an optimization strategy based on a robust model predictive control is proposed for handling the multiple uncertainties of source load. Here, the probability distributions of RES generation and load consumption predictions are determined using the Gaussian process regression method, and a minimum–maximum rolling optimization model is developed."
Dong2022,Optimization strategy based on robust model predictive control for RES-CCHP system under multiple uncertainties,pattern,9,12,pdf,12,no,no,"In day-ahead scheduling, the optimization objective is the operating costs, and the optimization constraints are system energy balance and equipment performance constraints, including Eqs. (1) – (14) and (25) – (28) . 10 shows the optimal power dispatch result by the RMPC-based OS combined with day-ahead scheduling of ESU. Table 5 presents the operating costs with or without day-ahead optimization scheduling of ESU."
Dong2022,Optimization strategy based on robust model predictive control for RES-CCHP system under multiple uncertainties,pattern,10,12,pdf,12,no,no,"The total maximum computational time of this OS is less than 15 min, which can ensure that the optimal scheduling results can be obtained within the scheduling interval. Due to the advantages of the day-ahead scheduling method in developing the ESU dispatch, in all subsequent RMPC optimization simulations, the ESU dispatch is given by the day-ahead scheduling method. 11 presents the optimal cooling dispatch result by the RMPC- based OS."
Tian2020,Short-term wind speed prediction based on LMD and improved FA optimized combined kernel function LSSVM,pattern,1,9,pdf,24,no,no,Coyote optimization algorithm: a new meta- heuristic for global optimization problems. In: 2018 IEEE Congress on Evolutionary Computation. Online load frequency control in wind integrated power systems using modified Jaya optimization.
Tian2020,Short-term wind speed prediction based on LMD and improved FA optimized combined kernel function LSSVM,pattern,2,8,pdf,3,yes,no,"At present, there is no definite theory and method to support how to determine the kernel function and the parameters of the kernel function. In order to improve the prediction accuracy of LSSVM and solve the problem of selecting the kernel function and the parameters of the kernel function in LSSVM algorithm, this paper uses global kernel function and local kernel function to construct the combined kernel function. The global kernel function is used to fit the distant correlation in the sample, and the local kernel function is used to approximate the correlation in the adjacent data domain, so as to improve the generalization ability of the LSSVM model."
Tian2020,Short-term wind speed prediction based on LMD and improved FA optimized combined kernel function LSSVM,pattern,3,8,pdf,3,yes,no,"In order to improve the prediction accuracy of LSSVM and solve the problem of selecting the kernel function and the parameters of the kernel function in LSSVM algorithm, this paper uses global kernel function and local kernel function to construct the combined kernel function. The global kernel function is used to fit the distant correlation in the sample, and the local kernel function is used to approximate the correlation in the adjacent data domain, so as to improve the generalization ability of the LSSVM model. In order to determine the optimal parameters of the combined kernel function LSSVM, an improved firefly algorithm (FA) is proposed to optimize the parameters."
