Tian2020,Short-term wind speed prediction based on LMD and improved FA optimized combined kernel function LSSVM,pattern,9,5,abstract,,no,no,"Accurate prediction of wind speed is of great significance to the operation and maintenance of wind farms, the optimal scheduling of turbines, and the safe and stable operation of power grids. A new prediction method for short-term wind speed based on local mean decomposition (LMD) and combined kernel function least squares support vector machine (LSSVM) is proposed."
Tian2020,Short-term wind speed prediction based on LMD and improved FA optimized combined kernel function LSSVM,pattern,10,3,pdf,1,no,no,"Engineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence 91 (2020) 103573 Contents lists available at ScienceDirect Engineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence journal homepage: www.elsevier.com/locate/engappai Short-term wind speed prediction based on LMD and improved FA optimized combined kernel function LSSVM✩ Zhongda Tian College of Information Science and Engineering, Shenyang University of Technology, Shenyang 110870, China A R T I C L E I N F O Keywords: Wind speed prediction Local mean decomposition Kernel function LSSVM Firefly algorithm A B S T R A C T Accurate prediction of wind speed is of great significance to the operation and maintenance of wind farms, the optimal scheduling of turbines, and the safe and stable operation of power grids. A new prediction method for short-term wind speed based on local mean decomposition (LMD) and combined kernel function least squares support vector machine (LSSVM) is proposed."
