Amjady2017,"Short term wind power prediction based on improved kriging interpolation, Empirical Mode Decomposition, and closed-loop forecasting engine",pattern,9,3,pdf,8,no,no,"Since post-predictor has the forecast generated by pre-predictor, which is an input close to the output, it is expected that post-predictor more accurately predicts the future values of the associated time series compared with pre-predictor. The next element in the feedback loop, i.e., comparator, evaluates this aspect. If the forecast of post-predictor is better than the forecast of pre-predictor, the forecast of post-predictor is feed backed through the feedback loop to replace the forecast of pre-predictor at the input of post-predictor."
