Yan2019625,Analytical Iterative Multistep Interval Forecasts of Wind Generation Based on TLGP,pattern,1,7,pdf,1,no,no,"Prob- abilistic forecasting has been widely used in the research of energy storage [3], reserve quantiﬁcation [4], unit commitment and market trading [5]. In [6], probabilistic forecasting was used to estimate dynamic operation reserve requirements based on the uncertainty information in each forecasting interval. It was found that probabilistic wind power forecasting, together with a proper demand dispatch plan, can contribute signiﬁcantly to the efﬁcient and economic operation of electricity markets and im- prove unit commitment."
